            "pair": "በገሣሥ -> በግሣጼ",
            "reason": "Both visually and philologically, the canonical Ge'ez/Andemta term in the cinco-mode healing formula is በግሣጼ ('by rebuke/command', alongside በሐልዮ and በነቢብ), where ግ was misread as ገ and ጼ as ሥ."
